3.
Authorities of the Institute.
The following shall be the authorities of the Institute, namely: -
(i) the Governing Council as constituted under section 11 of the Act;
(ii) the Senate as constituted under section 15 of the Act;
(iii) the Director as appointed under section 18 of the Act;
(iv) the Standing Committee of the Governing Council; and
(v) all Activity Chairpersons, Dean of Institute campuses, Registrar, Heads of Departments and Discipline Leads.

